      answer: '{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Came from Perth. Came flew in from Paris. It was very cold. Caught a flu there. Since then cough x 4/7 with dark red/grey phlegm. Taking pain meds sudafed, panadol/codeine. Fever on and off, sweaty++."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"no h/o asthma/bronchitis, IHD, BP, He worked in the iron ore mine and checked regularly."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Clinically sl SOB, SPO2: 94% said he is usually 94-5%"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"tonsillectomy done, mild pharyngitis, H/L: N"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"CXR"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"FBC /CRP/ Mycoplasma IgM"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"ecg"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Neb ventolin1ml:NACL 1ml: Pulmicort 2ml, recheck spo2 before sending to do CXR"}]}]}',
